===Use Clockwork to enter Rappa's past shadows{{subst:void|<!--103420701-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=continuance|location=Penacony Paperfold University College|Thrilling! Turns out Ninja Gama is not a renegade ninja, but a wise ninja with a solid plan. Now, use your ninjutsu to dive into the Dazzling Ninja Hero's fragmented memories in search of the panacea that promises the world's salvation!<br />Staring a ninja's past in the face may trigger stress responses. Please bring your own heart medications, sedatives, and adult diapers.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
----
:{{tx}}
<pre>{
	"$type": "RPG.GameCore.ResetMissionAudioState",
	"ResetBGMEmotionState": true
}</pre>
----
:'''Mr. Reca:''' I see... This talent would do well in special effect films.
:'''Mr. Reca:''' Ah, we have quite some fascinating actors today. One perpetually films before a green screen, another has been through a change of identities, and...
:'''"Assistant Director":''' ...
:'''Mr. Reca:''' And you, of course. The one with the most potential, Festive Superstar from the Land of the Dreams.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Better explain yourself, director.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Your camera's gonna be a victim of my bat~
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Traitorous ninja, engage me in combat!
:'''Mr. Reca:''' Please, let me apologize once more. Yes, it is true that I had a working relationship with Profnana, but I was coerced into it. As a {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|memetic lifeform}}, I inadvertently fell into the hands of my enemies and became infected with a lethal memetic virus.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're a Memokeeper?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're a Memory Zone Meme?
::'''Mr. Reca:''' No, not those. I have a much bigger role than those extras.
::You're a Slumbernana Monkey?
::'''Mr. Reca:''' No... at least not right now.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're a Slumbernana Monkey?
::'''Mr. Reca:''' No... at least not right now.
:'''Rappa:''' I see. The spatial ninjutsu that you displayed earlier was truly ingenious. I wouldn't be surprised if you were a Memo Ninja from the Garden of Zencollection.
:'''Dan Heng:''' So, am I right to see your act of betrayal at the Dean's Office as a ruse to teleport us to safety here?
:'''Mr. Reca:''' Perhaps I was just trying to bail myself out of the situation.
:'''Dan Heng:''' Bana yourself?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Bana?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Bana bana!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Bana...
:'''Dan Heng:''' Urk...
:{{tx}}
----
:'''Mr. Reca:''' Profnana Primon once called you... "the Doctor's failed creation."
:'''Mr. Reca:''' I am extremely interested in this. What lies behind your insistence on narrating everything from the intriguing worldview of a ninja?
:'''Mr. Reca:''' When I made the connection between that and the banacademics that we've seen earlier, I came to the realization that this might be the very reason you're immune to Slumbernana Monkey's corruption. What Profnana said also hinted at a possibility that links everything else up.
:'''Mr. Reca:''' That this is but another one of Dr. Primitive's experiments. As for you, actor Rappa, you were already infected with another memetic virus.
:'''Rappa:''' As stated in the ''Cosmic Ninjutsu Inscriptions'': "When used correctly, the venom of a scorpion neutralizes snake venom, just as poisoned wine may sometimes be used to quench thirst."
:'''Rappa:''' What you said is right. I once fell into the clutches of Osaru's domain, when sorcery ninjutsu was inflicted upon me. I had to undergo endless tribulations to break the fiendish spells. Only then did I manage to escape.
:'''Rappa:''' That memory has long become a story I leave behind in my past, though if Pinecany's future hinges on it... I am willing to bring back that memory and face it once more.
:'''Mr. Reca:''' Well, well, well. If the memetic entities can overwrite one another, so can memetic viruses. If we can just "edit" this virus out of our ninja actor's memory, there may be a way to destroy those nasty monkeys' Synesthesia Dreamscape.
:'''Mr. Reca:''' As the third act of a film, this can well be considered as a masterful development to the overall plot.
:'''Mr. Reca:''' And for the sake of propelling the plot forward, it looks like you'll have to take on a lead role again, Actor (Trailblazer).
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Me?
::Me?
::Do you mean Clockwork...?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Do you mean Clockwork...?
::Do you mean Clockwork...?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Watch Baseball Bat Ninja shine like a diamond!
::Watch Baseball Bat Ninja shine like a diamond!
::'''Mr. Reca:''' Memetic viruses, no matter the type, can be fatal to a Memokeeper. But that's not the case for you. As the protagonist, you will surely be able to unveil the truth behind the numerous layers of foreshadowing in this film.
::{{tx}}
:Watch Baseball Bat Ninja shine like a diamond!
:'''Mr. Reca:''' Memetic viruses, no matter the type, can be fatal to a Memokeeper. But that's not the case for you. As the protagonist, you will surely be able to unveil the truth behind the numerous layers of foreshadowing in this film.
:{{tx}}
;(Obtain {{Предмет|Memory-Peeking Film|20|x=1}})
:'''(Trailblazer):''' (The '''Banagibberish''' in my mind is getting clearer now... I have to move quickly...)

